scription":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2026-06-12T16:46:12Z","updated_at":"2026-06-15T23:32:51Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.6.3.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.3.stable - macOS Sequoia (15.7.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Apple M1 - Apple M1 (8 threads) - 16.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe next focus element in a Control node can be set in the Inspector. This affects tab and arrow keys, but the \"next element\" key in macOS VoiceOver screenreader does not recognize it.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nUsing the minimal reproduction project below:\n\n1. Make and run a Mac build.\n2. Notice that, from button 1, either right arrow, down arrow, or tab goes right to button 3.\n3. Navigate back to button 1 and start VoiceOver. Wait for it to recognize and read button 1.\n4. Press ctrl-option-space. Instead of button 3, it goes to button 2.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThis tiny project demonstrates the problem on commit aec4f5:\n\nhttps://github.com/PeterDrake/screenreader","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120247/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120247/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}